{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年36歲的歌手谷婭溦今日在社交平台撰寫長文，正式宣布與無綫（TVB）合約圓滿結束，為長達11年的賓主關係畫上句號。</p><p>她在文中深情回顧當年隻身來港發展的「港漂」心路歷程，感恩舊東家多年來的栽培，並以一句帥氣的「江湖再見」迎向人生新篇章。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.212716+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:51:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418600+00:00","content_hash":"7822de107cfc225e3f877516165b7a2d515b2cbf815a89326388d000857964b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}